{"title": "Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace", "pageid": 45175, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Tu'narath's_Embrace", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp, /w/images/1/1a/Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Legendary_Action_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> used by <a href=\"/wiki/Har%27rak\" title=\"Har'rak\">Har'rak</a> in Honour mode that lets him use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/25px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/38px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/50px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/25px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\">Tu'narath's Embrace</a> on nearby allies when they are attacked with an incapacitating condition.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round, Ch'r'ai Har'rak can spend a Legendary Action to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/25px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/38px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/50px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/25px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\">Tu'narath's Embrace</a> on an ally to prevent an <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">Incapacitating Condition</a>. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Tu.27narath.27s_Embrace\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Tu'narath's_Embrace\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Tu'narath's Embrace</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Paladin Har'rak can use a Legendary Action to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/25px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/38px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/50px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp/25px-Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tu%27narath%27s_Embrace\" title=\"Tu'narath's Embrace\">Tu'narath's Embrace</a> on an ally to prevent an <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">Incapacitating Condition</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Har%27rak\" title=\"Har'rak\">Har'rak</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<p>Examples of <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">Incapacitating Condition</a> in this legendary action include: <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\">Paralyzed</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Stunned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Stunned\">Stunned</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Restrained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Restrained\">Restrained</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(status_group)\" title=\"Polymorphed (status group)\">Polymorphed</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">Charmed</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dominated_(Condition)\" title=\"Dominated (Condition)\">Dominated</a>.\n</p>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202331\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1409/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15455/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6294/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansio